@startuml liquidityLayerFlowSeq1
' REVIEWED_MAIN_2026_05_13: aligned to current merged code; large-investment retained pending simplification merge.
actor Investor as I
actor "Pool Manager" as M
Box "Liquidity Program (on-chain)"
participant "LiquidityPool\n(PDA)" as LP
participant "Pool USDC\n(ATA)" as PUSDC
participant "Pool vToken\n(ATA)" as PVT
end box
Box "Vault Program (on-chain)"
participant "Vault" as V
participant "USDC Vault\n(ATA)" as UVAULT
participant "vToken Mint" as VTMINT
end box

autonumber

== Sync Investment (Instant Swap: USDC → vTokens) ==
I -> LP: [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/liquidity/src/instructions/investor/invest_sync.rs invest_sync(usdc_amount)]]
activate LP
note over LP
  Validates:
  - !pool.is_paused
  - pool.vault == vault
  - usdc_amount <= sync_invest_limit
  - investor whitelisted (vault whitelist PDA)
end note
LP -> V: Read live price via vault.get_vtoken_price(...)
note over LP
  vtoken_out = usdc × 1e6 × BPS / (live_price × (BPS + markup_bps))
  Require: pool_vtoken.amount >= vtoken_out
end note
I --> PUSDC: transfer_checked: USDC from investor → pool
LP -> LP: Thaw investor vToken account (if frozen)
PVT --> I: transfer_checked: vTokens from pool → investor
deactivate LP

== Sync Redemption (Instant Swap: vTokens → USDC) ==
I -> LP: [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/liquidity/src/instructions/investor/redeem_sync.rs redeem_sync(vtoken_amount)]]
activate LP
note over LP
  base_usdc = vtoken_amount × live_price / 1e6
  usdc_out = base_usdc × (BPS - spread_bps) / BPS
  Require: pool_usdc.amount >= usdc_out
end note
I --> PVT: transfer_checked: vTokens from investor → pool
PUSDC --> I: transfer_checked: USDC from pool → investor
deactivate LP

== Async Investment (CPI to Vault) ==
I -> LP: [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/liquidity/src/instructions/investor/invest_async.rs invest_async(usdc_amount, proposal_id)]]
activate LP
LP -> V: CPI: create_investment_proposal\n(investor as signer, USDC → vault)
deactivate LP
note over V
  InvestmentProposal PDA created
  USDC transferred to vault
  Settled later by curator
end note

== Async Redemption (CPI to Vault) ==
I -> LP: [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/liquidity/src/instructions/investor/redeem_async.rs redeem_async(vtoken_amount, proposal_id)]]
activate LP
LP -> V: CPI: create_redemption_proposal\n(investor as signer, vTokens → vault escrow)
deactivate LP

== Manager: Rebalance (USDC → vTokens via Vault) ==
M -> LP: [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/liquidity/src/instructions/manager/rebalance_invest_async.rs rebalance_invest_async(usdc_amount, proposal_id)]]
activate LP
note over LP
  Pool PDA signs as investor
  Manager pays rent for proposal PDA
end note
LP -> V: CPI: create_investment_proposal\n(pool PDA as investor, pool USDC → vault)
deactivate LP
note over V #LightCoral
  Pool must be whitelisted in vault
  for settlement to succeed
end note

== Manager: Rebalance (vTokens → USDC via Vault) ==
M -> LP: [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/liquidity/src/instructions/manager/rebalance_redeem_async.rs rebalance_redeem_async(vtoken_amount, proposal_id)]]
activate LP
LP -> V: CPI: create_redemption_proposal\n(pool PDA as investor, pool vTokens → vault escrow)
deactivate LP

== Manager: Inventory Management ==
M -> PUSDC: [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/liquidity/src/instructions/manager/deposit_usdc.rs deposit_usdc(amount)]] /\n[[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/liquidity/src/instructions/manager/withdraw_usdc.rs withdraw_usdc(amount)]]
M -> PVT: [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/liquidity/src/instructions/manager/deposit_vtokens.rs deposit_vtokens(amount)]] /\n[[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/liquidity/src/instructions/manager/withdraw_vtokens.rs withdraw_vtokens(amount)]]
note over M, PVT #pink
**No limits, timelocks, or multi-sig**
Manager has unrestricted access to
all pool funds.
end note

@enduml
